        <p>If you're looking to contact me, you've come to the right place!</p>
        <p>
            You can reach me via email at
            <a href="mailto:benthedev@outlook.com">benthedev@outlook.com</a>
        </p>
        <p>
            through my LinkedIn profile at
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ben-clarke-ie/">LinkedIn</a>
